# F1 unified-projection retirement allowlist.
# Format: substring patterns to filter from grep hits.
# Each entry must have a documented reason in the comment-line above it.

# MLR retained per spec mitigation (c) -- mlrclipper.cpp:206-209,305,321,347
# reads cameraToClip(2,2)/(3,2) for legacy gosFX rendering; dev-override only.
mclib/mlr/

# Shadow shaders legitimately use bare 'mvp' (depth-only pass with own MVP).
shaders/shadow_terrain.vert

# HUD shaders legitimately use bare 'mvp' (2D ortho overlay, no projection
# round-trip; HUD allowlist per spec §6.2.1).
shaders/gos_text.vert
shaders/gos_vertex.vert
shaders/gos_vertex_lighted.vert
shaders/gos_tex_vertex.vert

# Shadow CPU mvp lookup (gameos_graphics.cpp:1795 area; uses its own depth-
# only matrix, not the F1 unified projection).
shadowLocs_.mvp

# Pre-existing gos_terrain.vert uses bare 'mvp' for a draw path orthogonal
# to F1 (cleanup tracked separately).
shaders/gos_terrain.vert
